\section{Cosmological Evolution}

Assuming homogeneity and isotropy:
\begin{equation}
\nabla \cdot \mathbf{v}_I = 3H_I,
\end{equation}
the IFE becomes:
\begin{equation}
\dot{\rho}_I + 3H_I \rho_I = 3\alpha H_I + \beta \rho_I^2.
\end{equation}

The emergent Hubble parameter is:
\begin{equation}
H(t) = \mathcal{G}(\rho_I, \dot{\rho}_I),
\end{equation}
defining the informational cosmological expansion.